🔖 Interactive CNN Layer-by-Layer Explanation

With the CNN Explainer, you can learn about:
🫡 Input RGB channels;
🫡 Convolution;
🫡 ReLU;
🫡 Max Pooling;
🫡 Activation maps;
🫡 Flatten;
🫡 Softmax;
🫡 Final prediction.

You can upload your own image and see how the network processes it step by step.
⛓ https://poloclub.github.io/cnn-explainer/

